      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additionally, you can start full screen, go to windowed, maximize, and go back to full screen and get black bars.\nIf you resize the window in windowed mode and then go to full screen, the resulting render window remains the same shape and is stretched to the screen bounds with black bars.\nMaybe we make VRC reset the display dimensions on full screen?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
