      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "this doesn't happen anymore (well, at least to me).\n\nhowever, the window's resolution is still used when you >start< VRC with a pre-configured (in launch options) resolution and in fullscreen (i.e. when the last time you used it it was in fullscreen), until you exit an re-enter fullscreen mode again.\n\nreported that in a more detailed way here: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/desktop-fullscreen-mode-starts-at-wrong-resolution",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
