  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-09-17T16:10:06.930Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When entering full screen mode via alt+enter, VRChat likes to re-use the windowed resolution for full screen.\nThis results in resolution stretching and / or black bars on the edge of the screen.\nTo replicate: Start VRChat in windowed mode. Maximize the window. Enter fullscreen.",
